WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.830
I've watched eleven episodes. Should I deposit now?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.916
Learning how doesn't mean you have to invest.

00:00:11.916 --> 00:00:14.996
Today, with practice money only, we'll run one flow:

00:00:14.996 --> 00:00:19.201
check the entry and eligibility, find spot, confirm the amount and fee,

00:00:19.201 --> 00:00:20.860
then check the trade record.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:42.658
Even if the price falls in practice, you can still do everything right.

00:00:42.658 --> 00:00:44.770
We score whether you checked and understood,

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.690
not whether you happened to pick a rise.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.200
Something's wrong with this transfer. I'm not sending it.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:22.535
That's a correct answer too. When the network, fees or identity aren't clear,

00:01:22.535 --> 00:01:25.260
stopping matters more than forcing the task through.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:51.248
Finally, say three things back. Where did the asset go? How much was actually taken?

00:01:51.248 --> 00:01:52.795
Who controls your account?

00:01:52.795 --> 00:01:56.900
If you can't explain one, go back to that episode and practise again.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:14.301
What you've earned is a learning record, not a licence to invest.

00:02:14.301 --> 00:02:19.350
Keep learning, or don't trade for now. Both are fine. Understand first, then act.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:30.293
When you do decide to start, compare exchanges side by side on NexuAlpha.

00:02:30.293 --> 00:02:34.945
Register through an official partner link with our code, get part of your fees back,

00:02:34.945 --> 00:02:37.050
and join our Telegram for new lessons.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:42.520
Season 2: the price on your screen isn't always the price you pay. Find out why.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.830
Understand first, then act.
